  "@type": "Dataset",
  "name": "Groundfish Stomach Contents - U.S. Waters",
  "description": "Measurement Details Taxonomic identification, weights, and counts of prey in Groundfish stomach contents. Emphasis on identification of commercially important prey to species level when possible. Prey weight measured to nearest milligram. Geographic Area Shelf and slope regions of the eastern Bering Sea, Gulf of Alaska, Aleutian Islands, and Washington Oregon California areas. Publication Numerous publications available on request from the contact person Other Comments sporadic collections (mostly in the summer) A TCODE project\n\nDeposited content: descriptive metadata only; underlying research data are not included.",
